## 📊 Data Flow & Business Logic

### 🆕 **NEW STANDARD**: Server-Side Data Flow

```mermaid
graph TD
    A[User Request] --> B[Next.js Server Component]
    B --> C[Server-Side Auth Check]
    C --> D{Authenticated?}
    D -->|No| E[Redirect to Login]
    D -->|Yes| F[Server-Side Data Fetching]
    F --> G[Database Query via Server Actions]
    G --> H[Data Processing]
    H --> I[Pass Data to Client View Component]
    I --> J[Client-Side Rendering]
    J --> K[User Interactions]
    K --> L[Client-Side State Management]
```

